Example content: the Wiki Page "Tabellenbreiten" in the GreenCat workspace shows every width a wiki table can have, one table per case (text width, Medium, Wide, Full width, a custom width set by the resize handle, a centred table, a table wider than the page) and links to the other table demo pages; created by the distribution post handler on new sites (existing demo pages are kept) and by `scripts/table_demo_content.py` (REST) on existing sites. The script now also creates the CSV table demo and replaces a demo page that is locked in the editor. https://gitlab.kitconcept.io/kitconcept/distribution-kitconcept-intranet/-/work_items/827 @reekitconcept
